ll not be updated. Please confirm that all your MabangERP orders from CJ have been fulfilled.","authorize-list-after-authorization-is-removed-1":"1. After the authorization is removed, the orders generated by the current overseas warehouse will no longer be pulled. Please go to MabangERP ERP - Logistics - Logistics Authorization - Third-Party\u002FOverseas Warehouse menu to cancel the CJ overseas warehouse authorization to avoid your orders being pushed to the CJ overseas warehouse and unable to be fulfilled.","authorize-list-after-authorization-is-removed-1--plural":"1. After the authorization is removed, the orders generated by the current overseas warehouse will no longer be pulled. Please go to MabangERP ERP - Logistics - Logistics Authorization - Third-Party\u002FOverseas Warehouse menu to cancel the CJ overseas warehouse authorization to avoid your orders being pushed to the CJ overseas warehouse and unable to be fulfilled.","authorize-list-how-to-connect-platform-with-site-name":"How to Connect {{platform}} with {{siteName}}?","authorize-list-how-to-connect-platform-with-site-name--plural":"How to Connect {{platform}} with {{siteName}}?","authorize-list-store-status":"Store Status","authorize-list-store-status--plural":"Store Status","authorize-list-store-id":"Store ID","authorize-list-store-id--plural":"Store ID","authorize-list-update-authorize":"Update Authorize","authorize-list-update-authorize--plural":"Update Authorize","authorize-list-transfer-store":"Transfer Store","authorize-list-transfer-store--plural":"Transfer Store","authorize-list-tiktok-shop-us-products":"TikTok Shop US Products","authorize-list-tiktok-shop-us-products--plural":"TikTok Shop US Products","authorize-list-you-have-not-authorized-any-stores-yet":"You haven't authorized any stores yet.","authorize-list-you-have-not-authorized-any-stores-yet--plural":"You haven't authorized any stores yet.","authorize-list-token-expired-time":"Token Expired Time","authorize-list-token-expired-time--