"agents-cj-account-management-logistics-monitoring-point-item-3-tilte":"Benefit:","agents-cj-account-management-logistics-monitoring-point-item-3-tilte--plural":"Benefit:","agents-cj-account-management-unclear-terms":"Unclear terms","agents-cj-account-management-unclear-terms--plural":"Unclear terms","agents-cj-account-management-order-management-point-item-3-desc":"Zero manual re-keying, instantaneous visibility on every order's status.","agents-cj-account-management-order-management-point-item-3-desc--plural":"Zero manual re-keying, instantaneous visibility on every order's status.","agents-cj-account-management-no-early-warnings":"No early warnings","agents-cj-account-management-no-early-warnings--plural":"No early warnings","agents-cj-account-management-multiple-points-of-contact":"Multiple points of contact","agents-cj-account-management-multiple-points-of-contact--plural":"Multiple points of contact","agents-cj-account-management-contract-terms-management-point-item-1-desc":"Hidden fees and shifting lead-times derail my forecasts.","agents-cj-account-management-contract-terms-management-point-item-1-desc--plural":"Hidden fees and shifting lead-times derail my forecasts.","agents-cj-account-management-logistics-monitoring-point-item-3-desc":"Complete transparency, fewer surprises, and on-time performance above 98%.","agents-cj-account-management-logistics-monitoring-point-item-3-desc--plural":"Complete transparency, fewer surprises, and on-time performance above 98%.","agents-cj-account-management-contract-terms-management-point-item-3-desc":"Hidden fees and shifting lead-times derail my forecasts.","agents-cj-account-management-contract-terms-management-point-item-3-desc--plural":"Hidden fees and shifting lead-times derail my forecasts.","agents-cj-account-management-faq-1-answer":"Your Account Manager acts as your dedicated point of contact—overseeing sourcing, order flow, logistics, communication with suppliers, and performance reporting.","agents-cj-account-management-faq-1-answer--plural":"Your Account Manager acts as your dedicated point of contact—overseeing sourcing, order flow, logistics, communication with suppliers, and performance reporting.","agents-cj-account-management-errors-delays":"Errors & delays","agents-cj-account-management-errors-delays--plural":"Errors & delays","agents-cj-account-management-logistics-monitoring-desc":"Live tracking & rapid escalation across every shipment milestone.","agents-cj-account-management-logistics-monitoring-desc--plural":"Live tracking & rapid escalation across every shipment milestone.","agents-cj-account-management-professional-manager-liaison-point-item-2-tilte":"Solution:","agents-cj-account-management-professional-manager-liaison-point-item-2-tilte--plural":"Solution:","agents-cj-account-management-faq-3-answer":"Absolutely. Your manager provides fast-track escalation paths for supplier issues, order delays, and customs problems to minimize business disruption.","agents-cj-account-management-faq-3-answer--plural":"Absolutely. Your manager provides fast-track escalation paths for supplier issues, order delays, and customs problems to minimize business disruption.","agents-cj-account-management-faq-5-answer":"Both. Whether you're scaling or already high-volume, the service is tailored to help you streamline and grow with less operational burden.","agents-cj-account-management-faq-5-answer--plural":"Both. Whether you're scaling or already high-volume, the service is tailored to help you streamline and grow with less operational burden.","agents-cj-account-management-customized-reporting-insights":"Customized Reporting & Insights","agents-cj-account-management-customized-reporting-insights--plural":"Customized Reporting & Insights","agents-cj-account-management-contract-terms-management-point-item-3-tilte":"Benefit:","agents-cj-account-management-contract-terms-management-point-item-3-tilte--plural":"Benefit:","agents-cj-account-management-schedule-your-free-fulfillment-audits":"Schedule Your Free Fulfillment Audits","agents-cj-account-management-schedule-your-free-fulfillment-audits--plural":"Schedule Your Free Fulfillment Audits","agents-cj-account-management-logistics-monitoring-point-item-2-desc":"Real-time shipment tracking, proactive delay alerts, and dedicated escalation for customs or carrier issues.","agents-cj-account-management-logistics-monitoring-point-item-2-desc--plural":"Real-time shipment tracking, proactive delay alerts, and dedicated escalation for customs or carrier issues.","agents-cj-account-management-kick-off":"Kick-off","agents-cj-account-management-kick-off--plural":"Kick-off","agents-cj-account-management-po-execution":"P.O. Execution","agents-cj-account-management-po-execution--plural":"P.O. Execution","agents-cj-account-management-contract-terms-management-point-item-2-tilte":"Solution:","agents-cj-account-management-contract-terms-management-point-item-2-tilte--plural":"Solution:","agents-cj-account-management-live-logistics-command-control-desc":"With direct access to carrier dashboards and customs brokers, your manager monitors shipments 24\u002F7 and expedites any delays.","agents-cj-account-management-live-logistics-command-control-desc--plural":"With direct access to carrier dashboards and customs brokers, your manager monitors shipments 24\u002F7 and expedites any delays.","agents-cj-account-management-professional-manager-liaison-desc":"A dedicated expert who champions your project and streamlines communication.","agents-cj-account-management-professional-manager-liaison-desc--plural":"A dedicated expert who champions your project and streamlines communication.","agents-cj-account-management-reporting-analytics-desc":"Custom dashboards & monthly reviews that surface cost-savings and performance wins.","agents-cj-account-management-reporting-analytics-desc--plural":"Custom dashboards & monthly reviews that surface cost-savings and performance wins.","agents-cj-account-management-logistics-oversight":"Logistics Oversight","agents-cj-account-management-logistics-oversight--plural":"Logistics Oversight","agents-cj-account-management-customized-reporting-insights-desc":"Receive tailored dashboards and monthly business reviews designed by your manager to spotlight cost-savings, performance wins, and growth opportunities.","agents-cj-account-management-customized-reporting-insights-desc--plural":"Receive tailored dashboards and monthly business reviews designed by your manager to spotlight cost-savings, performance wins, and growth opportunities.","agents-cj-account-management-monthly-review":"Monthly Review","agents-cj-account-management-monthly-review--plural":"Monthly Review","agents-cj-account-management-manager-assignment":"Manager Assignment","agents-cj-account-management-manager-assignment--plural":"Manager Assignment","agents-cj-account-management-reporting-analytics-point-item-1-desc":"“I lack the data to improve my supply chain.”","agents-cj-account-management-reporting-analytics-point-item-1-desc--plural":"“I lack the data to improve my supply chain.”","agents-cj-account-management-professional-manager-liaison":"Professional Manager Liaison","agents-cj-account-management-professional-manager-liaison--plural":"Professional Manager Liaison","agents-cj-account-management-contract-terms-management-point-item-2-desc":"We draft, negotiate, and enforce clear MOQs, payment terms, penalties, and change-order clauses.","agents-cj-account-management-contract-terms-management-point-item-2-desc--plural":"We draft, negotiate, and enforce clear MOQs, payment terms, penalties, and change-order clauses.","agents-cj-account-management-reporting-analytics":"Reporting & Analytics","agents-cj-account-management-reporting-analytics--plural":"Reporting & Analytics","agents-cj-account-management-faq-2-answer":"Yes. We assign Account Managers with experience relevant to your niche, ensuring they understand your supply chain needs and product specifications.","agents-cj-account-management-faq-2-answer--plural":"Yes. We assign Account Managers with experience relevant to your niche, ensuring they understand your supply chain needs and product specifications.","agents-cj-account-management-faq-6-answer":"Yes. Your manager has access to real-time logistics tools and will proactively monitor and resolve shipping or customs-related issues.","agents-cj-account-management-faq-6-answer--plural":"Yes. Your manager has access to real-time logistics tools and will proactively monitor and resolve shipping or customs-related issues.","common-mycj-menu-3pl-inventory":"Inventory","common-mycj-menu-3pl-export-list":"Export List","common-mycj-menu-3pl-store-products-tip":"Check here for your store products, where you can make product connections.","common-mycj-menu-3pl-custom-packaging":"Custom Packaging","common-mycj-menu-3pl-credit-service":"Credit Service","common-mycj-menu-3pl-credit-service--plural":"Credit Service","common-mycj-menu-3pl-my-inventory-tip":"Check your inventory here if you have brought private inventory, packaging, or deposit inventory.","common-mycj-menu-3pl-authorization-new":"Apps","common-mycj-menu-3pl-authorization-new--plural":"Apps","common-mycj-menu-3pl-shopify":"Shopify","common-mycj-menu-3pl-custom-packaging-tip":"Purchase or design packaging and connect packages with your products.","common-mycj-menu-3pl-my-inventory":"My Inventory","common-mycj-menu-3pl-sales-orders":"Sales Orders","common-mycj-menu-3pl-sales-orders--plural":"Sales Orders","common-mycj-menu-3pl-wallet":"Wallet","common-mycj-menu-3pl-orders":"Orders","common-mycj-menu-3pl-products":"Products","common-mycj-menu-3pl-inventory-orders":"Inventory Orders","common-mycj-menu-3pl-fulfillment-status":"Fulfillment Status","common-mycj-menu-3pl-undelivered-orders":"Undelivered Orders","common-mycj-menu-3pl-disputes":"Disputes","common-mycj-menu-3pl-my-products":"My Products","common-mycj-menu-3pl-store-products":"Store Products","common-mycj-menu-3pl-shipment":"Shipment","common-mycj-menu-3pl-partnership":"Partnership","common-mycj-menu-3pl-affiliate":"Affiliate","common-mycj-3pl-my-account":"My Account","common-mycj-3pl-my-account--plural":"My Account","common-mycj-menu-3pl-setting":"Settings","common-mycj-menu-3pl-ticket":"Ticket","common-mycj-menu-3pl-orders-fulfillment":"Fulfillment","common-mycj-menu-3pl-orders-fulfillment--plural":"Fulfillment","my-profile-once-the-switch-is-enabled-accessing":"Once the switch is enabled, accessing the app via a Shopify link will automatically log you into your account. This may lead to insecure account access, so please enable with caution.‌","my-profile-once-the-switch-is-enabled-accessing--plural":"Once the switch is enabled, accessing the app via a Shopify link will automatically log you into your account. This may lead to insecure account access, so please enable with caution.‌","my-profile-shopify-redirect-auto-login":"Shopify redirect auto-login","my-profile-shopify-redirect-auto-login--plural":"Shopify redirect auto-login","agents-faster-order-fulfillment-process-packaging-pre-check-subtitle-new":"Pre-Set Packaging","agents-faster-order-fulfillment-process-packaging-pre-check-subtitle-new--plural":"Pre-Set Packaging","agents-faster-order-fulfillment-pre-set-packaging-new":"Pre-Set Packaging","agents-faster-order-fulfillment-pre-set-packaging-new--plural":"Pre-Set Packaging","agents-faster-order-fulfillment-sign-up-free":"Sign Up Free","agents-faster-order-fulfillment-sign-up-free--plural":"Sign Up Free","agents-product-development-get-customized-strategy-new":"Get a Custom Strategy","agents-product-development-get-customized-strategy-new--plural":"Get a Custom Strategy","agents-shorten-delivery-time-key-benefits":"Key Benefits","agents-shorten-delivery-time-key-benefits--plural":"Key Benefits","agents-shorten-delivery-time-process-order-placement":"Order Placement","agents-shorten-delivery-time-process-order-placement--plural":"Order Placement","agents-product-development-process-trial-production":"Trial Production","agents-product-development-process-trial-production--plural":"Trial Production","agents-product-development-define-requirements-new":"Define Your Requirements","agents-product-development-define-requirements-new--plural":"Define Your Requirements","agents-product-development-contact-supply-chain-exper-new":"Consult a Supply Chain Expert","agents-product-development-contact-supply-chain-exper-new--plural":"Consult a Supply Chain Expert","agents-cogs-reduction-bloated-logistics-inventory-desc":"Misaligned strategies and high buffer stocks lead to soaring storage and transport expenses.","agents-cogs-reduction-bloated-logistics-inventory-desc--plural":"Misaligned strategies and high buffer stocks lead to soaring storage and transport expenses.","agents-cj-account-management-professional-manager-liaison-point-item-1-desc-new":"Who is my point of contact when issues arise?","agents-cj-account-management-professional-manager-liaison-point-item-1-desc-new--plural":"Who is my point of contact when issues arise?","agents-cj-account-management-professional-manager-liaison-point-item-2-desc-new":"A single “Gold-Level” account manager proactively coordinates factories, QC teams, and carriers on your behalf.","agents-cj-account-management-professional-manager-liaison-point-item-2-desc-new--plural":"A single “Gold-Level” account manager proactively coordinates factories, QC teams, and carriers on your behalf.","agents-cogs-reduction-production-inefficiencies":"Production Inefficiencies","agents-cogs-reduction-production-inefficiencies--plural":"Production Inefficiencies","agents-cogs-reduction-bloated-logistics-inventory":"Bloated Logistics & Inventory","agents-cogs-reduction-bloated-logistics-inventory--plural":"Bloated Logistics & Inventory","agents-cogs-reduction-production-inefficiencies-desc":"Suboptimal yields and line waste drive up your indirect costs per unit, directly eroding your profit margin.","agents-cogs-reduction-production-inefficiencies-desc--plural":"Suboptimal yields and line waste drive up your indirect costs per unit, directly eroding your profit margin.","agents-cj-account-management-sign-up-free":"Sign Up Free","agents-cj-account-management-sign-up-free--plural":"Sign Up Free","agents-cogs-reduction-weak-supplier-leverage-desc":"Limited sourcing options and no market intelligence undermine your negotiation power.","agents-cogs-reduction-weak-supplier-leverage-desc--plural":"Limited sourcing options and no market intelligence undermine your negotiation power.","agents-cj-account-management-contract-terms-management-point-item-3-desc-new":"Secure, transparent pricing and predictable lead-time commitments.","agents-cj-account-management-contract-terms-management-point-item-3-desc-new--plural":"Secure, transparent pricing and predictable lead-time commitments.","agents-cogs-reduction-weak-supplier-leverage":"Weak Supplier Leverage","agents-cogs-reduction-weak-supplier-leverage--plural":"Weak Supplier Leverage","agents-cogs-reduction-opaque-cost-structure":"Opaque Cost Structure","agents-cogs-reduction-opaque-cost-structure--plural":"Opaque Cost Structure","agents-cogs-reduction-opaque-cost-structure-desc":"Lack of clear breakdowns across materials, labor, and logistics, making targeted savings impossible.","agents-cogs-reduction-opaque-cost-structure-desc--plural":"Lack of clear breakdowns across materials, labor, and logistics, making targeted savings impossible.","agents-cogs-reduction-faq-4-answer-new":"Yes-we partner with bonded, FBA prep, and 3PL warehouses in North America, EU, and Asia.","agents-cogs-reduction-faq-4-answer-new--plural":"Yes-we partner with bonded, FBA prep, and 3PL warehouses in North America, EU, and Asia.","agents-customer-success-growth-hands-on-case-application-desc":"We don't just share success stories; your manager guides you through adapting proven tactics to your unique context.","agents-customer-success-growth-hands-on-case-application-desc--plural":"We don't just share success stories; your manager guides you through adapting proven tactics to your unique context.","agents-customer-success-growth-gap-between-insights-and-execution":"Gap Between Insights and Execution","agents-customer-success-growth-gap-between-insights-and-execution--plural":"Gap Between Insights and Execution","agents-customer-success-growth-underleveraged-success-models-desc":"Failure to systematically replicate best practices from top-performing cases, leading to inefficiencies and avoidable mistakes.","agents-customer-success-growth-underleveraged-success-models-desc--plural":"Failure to systematically replicate best practices from top-performing cases, leading to inefficiencies and avoidable mistakes.","agents-customer-success-growth-performance-review-iteration":"Performance Review & Iteration","agents-customer-success-growth-performance-review-iteration--plural":"Performance Review & Iteration","agents-customer-success-growth-ineffective-marketing-efforts-desc":"Scattered campaigns and unfocused messaging result in low ROI and wasted ad spend.","agents-customer-success-growth-ineffective-marketing-efforts-desc--plural":"Scattered campaigns and unfocused messaging result in low ROI and wasted ad spend.","agents-cogs-reduction-warehousing-logistics-highlight-new":"Opening bonded warehouses in Germany and the U.S. (combined €5,000\u002Fmo.) saved an average of €2.20 per order in shipping and VAT-over €50,000 annually.","agents-cogs-reduction-warehousing-logistics-highlight-new--plural":"Opening bonded warehouses in Germany and the U.S. (combined €5,000\u002Fmo.) saved an average of €2.20 per order in shipping and VAT-over €50,000 annually.","agents-cogs-reduction-faq-1-answer-new":"Typical savings range from 5-20% depending on your volumes and product complexity.","agents-cogs-reduction-faq-1-answer-new--plural":"Typical savings range from 5-20% depending on your volumes and product complexity.","agents-cogs-reduction-get-customized-strategy-new":"Get a Custom Strategy","agents-cogs-reduction-get-customized-strategy-new--plural":"Get a Custom Strategy","agents-customer-success-growth-kickoff-goal-setting":"Kickoff & Goal-Setting","agents-customer-success-growth-kickoff-goal-setting--plural":"Kickoff & Goal-Setting","agents-customer-success-growth-real-time-performance-tracking-desc":"With direct access to carrier dashboards and customs brokers, your manager monitors shipments 24\u002F7 and expedites any delays.","agents-customer-success-growth-real-time-performance-tracking-desc--plural":"With direct access to carrier dashboards and customs brokers, your manager monitors shipments 24\u002F7 and expedites any delays.","agents-customer-success-growth-underleveraged-success-models":"Underleveraged Success Models","agents-customer-success-growth-underleveraged-success-models--plural":"Underleveraged Success Models","agents-customer-success-growth-faq-1-answer":"A strategic partnership where we combine market intelligence, tailored marketing guidance, and actionable plans to help you grow faster and more sustainably.","agents-customer-success-growth-faq-1-answer--plural":"A strategic partnership where we combine market intelligence, tailored marketing guidance, and actionable plans to help you grow faster and more sustainably.","agents-customer-success-growth-ready-to-transform-your-order-fulfillment-speed":"Ready to Transform Your Order Fulfillment Speed?","agents-customer-success-growth-ready-to-transform-your-order-fulfillment-speed--plural":"Ready to Transform Your Order Fulfillment Speed?","agents-cogs-reduction-robust-risk-mitigation-desc-new":"We build early-warning systems for price volatility, supply disruptions, and currency swings-paired with contingency planning-to keep your operations steady.","agents-cogs-reduction-robust-risk-mitigation-desc-new--plural":"We build early-warning systems for price volatility, supply disruptions, and currency swings-paired with contingency planning-to keep your operations steady.","agents-cogs-reduction-customized-sustainable-roadmap-desc-new":"Beyond one-off savings, we create a continuous improvement blueprint-complete with governance, KPIs, and change-management support-to lock in lower COGS for the long term.","agents-cogs-reduction-customized-sustainable-roadmap-desc-new--plural":"Beyond one-off savings, we create a continuous improvement blueprint-complete with governance, KPIs, and change-management support-to lock in lower COGS for the long term.","agents-customer-success-growth-hands-on-case-application":"Hands-On Case Application","agents-customer-success-growth-hands-on-case-application--plural":"Hands-On Case Application","agents-cogs-reduction-product-packaging-highlight-new":"Replacing a 500g corrugated box with a 350g reinforced mailer cut packaging cost by 18% and international shipping by 12%.","agents-cogs-reduction-product-packaging-highlight-new--plural":"Replacing a 500g corrugated box with a 350g reinforced mailer cut packaging cost by 18% and international shipping by 12%.","agents-customer-success-growth-uncertain-expansion-path-desc":"No clear roadmap for entering new regions or verticals, creating hesitation and risk in growth initiatives.","agents-customer-success-growth-uncertain-expansion-path-desc--plural":"No clear roadmap for entering new regions or verticals, creating hesitation and risk in growth initiatives.","agents-customer-success-growth-schedule-your-free-fulfillment-audits":"Schedule Your Free Fulfillment Audits","agents-customer-success-growth-schedule-your-free-fulfillment-audits--plural":"Schedule Your Free Fulfillment Audits","agents-customer-success-growth-ineffective-marketing-efforts":"Ineffective Marketing Efforts","agents-customer-success-growth-ineffective-marketing-efforts--plural":"Ineffective Marketing Efforts","agents-customer-success-growth-gap-between-insights-and-execution-desc":"Data reports exist but lack actionable, step-by-step plans to turn insights into results.","agents-customer-success-growth-gap-between-insights-and-execution-desc--plural":"Data reports exist but lack actionable, step-by-step plans to turn insights into results.","agents-customer-success-growth-faq-4-answer":"You receive bi-weekly playbooks with specific tasks, owners, due dates, and alignment to your KPIs, all tracked in a shared project board.","agents-customer-success-growth-faq-4-answer--plural":"You receive bi-weekly playbooks with specific tasks, owners, due dates, and alignment to your KPIs, all tracked in a shared project board.","agents-customer-success-growth-cross-functional-coordination-desc":"Receive tailored dashboards and monthly business reviews designed by your manager to spotlight cost-savings, performance wins, and growth opportunities.","agents-customer-success-growth-cross-functional-coordination-desc--plural":"Receive tailored dashboards and monthly business reviews designed by your manager to spotlight cost-savings, performance wins, and growth opportunities.","agents-customer-success-growth-real-time-performance-tracking":"Real-Time Performance Tracking","agents-customer-success-growth-real-time-performance-tracking--plural":"Real-Time Performance Tracking","agents-customer-success-growth-dedicated-success-manager-desc":"Your personal strategic partner—deeply versed in your product, market, and goals—ensuring every recommendation aligns with your KPIs.","agents-customer-success-growth-dedicated-success-manager-desc--plural":"Your personal strategic partner—deeply versed in your product, market, and goals—ensuring every recommendation aligns with your KPIs.","agents-cogs-reduction-proven-track-record-roi-focus-desc-new":"Clients benefit from our track record of delivering 5-15% COGS reductions within 6-12 months, ensuring tangible bottom-line impact and quick payback.","agents-cogs-reduction-proven-track-record-roi-focus-desc-new--plural":"Clients benefit from our track record of delivering 5-15% COGS reductions within 6-12 months, ensuring tangible bottom-line impact and quick payback.","agents-cogs-reduction-desc-2-new":"Develop bulk-buy plans, packaging redesigns & sourcing scorecards.","agents-cogs-reduction-desc-2-new--plural":"Develop bulk-buy plans, packaging redesigns & sourcing scorecards.","agents-customer-success-growth-proactive-market-intelligence-desc":"Your manager delivers ahead-of-curve trend alerts and competitive insights, so you pivot before your rivals do.","agents-customer-success-growth-proactive-market-intelligence-desc--plural":"Your manager delivers ahead-of-curve trend alerts and competitive insights, so you pivot before your rivals do.","agents-customer-success-growth-lack-of-market-visibility-desc":"Unable to capture real-time industry trends and consumer shifts, leading to delayed decisions and missed opportunities.","agents-customer-success-growth-lack-of-market-visibility-desc--plural":"Unable to capture real-time industry trends and consumer shifts, leading to delayed decisions and missed opportunities.","agents-customer-success-growth-faq-4":"How are action recommendations delivered?","agents-customer-success-growth-faq-4--plural":"How are action recommendations delivered?","agents-customer-success-growth-faq-5":"How quickly can I expect to see results?","agents-customer-success-growth-faq-5--plural":"How quickly can I expect to see results?","agents-customer-success-growth-uncertain-expansion-path":"Uncertain Expansion Path","agents-customer-success-growth-uncertain-expansion-path--plural":"Uncertain Expansion Path","agents-customer-success-growth-faq-2":"Who will lead my account?","agents-customer-success-growth-faq-2--plural":"Who will lead my account?","agents-customer-success-growth-faq-3":"How do you recommend new markets for expansion?","agents-customer-success-growth-faq-3--plural":"How do you recommend new markets for expansion?","agents-customer-success-growth-faq-1":"What is “Driving Customer Success”?","agents-customer-success-growth-faq-1--plural":"What is “Driving Customer Success”?","agents-cogs-reduction-production-efficiency-yield-improvement-desc-new":"Through lean manufacturing audits and Six Sigma principles, we help you boost line throughput and product yield-reducing scrap, rework, and indirect cost allocation.","agents-cogs-reduction-production-efficiency-yield-improvement-desc-new--plural":"Through lean manufacturing audits and Six Sigma principles, we help you boost line throughput and product yield-reducing scrap, rework, and indirect cost allocation.","agents-customer-success-growth-data-gathering-analysis":"Data Gathering & Analysis","agents-customer-success-growth-data-gathering-analysis--plural":"Data Gathering & Analysis","agents-cogs-reduction-desc-4-new":"Monitor KPIs, renegotiate, and realize incremental savings.","agents-cogs-reduction-desc-4-new--plural":"Monitor KPIs, renegotiate, and realize incremental savings.","agents-cogs-reduction-faq-2-answer-new":"No-our lean pack designs are pilot-tested for packing speed and drop-testing.","agents-cogs-reduction-faq-2-answer-new--plural":"No-our lean pack designs are pilot-tested for packing speed and drop-testing.","agents-customer-success-growth-sign-up-free":"Sign Up Free","agents-customer-success-growth-sign-up-free--plural":"Sign Up Free","agents-cogs-reduction-define-requirements-new":"Define Your Requirements","agents-cogs-reduction-define-requirements-new--plural":"Define Your Requirements","agents-customer-success-growth-faq-3-answer":"We assess demand signals, regulatory hurdles, logistics feasibility, and competitive landscapes to produce a prioritized “Market Entry Scorecard”.","agents-customer-success-growth-faq-3-answer--plural":"We assess demand signals, regulatory hurdles, logistics feasibility, and competitive landscapes to produce a prioritized “Market Entry Scorecard”.","agents-customer-success-growth-faq-5-answer":"Many clients report noticeable uplifts—like improved conversion rates or faster market launches—within 