cess-growth-faq-2-answer":"You’ll have a dedicated Customer Success Manager (CSM) who knows your business inside and out and serves as your single point of contact.","agents-customer-success-growth-faq-2-answer--plural":"You’ll have a dedicated Customer Success Manager (CSM) who knows your business inside and out and serves as your single point of contact.","agents-visiting-guide-quality-audit-expertise":"Guided factory walkthroughs, spot inspections, and coordination of ISO\u002FBSCI lab tests or material analyses.","agents-visiting-guide-quality-audit-expertise--plural":"Guided factory walkthroughs, spot inspections, and coordination of ISO\u002FBSCI lab tests or material analyses.","agents-visiting-guide-one-stop-itinerary-planning":"One-Stop Itinerary Planning","agents-visiting-guide-one-stop-itinerary-planning--plural":"One-Stop Itinerary Planning","agents-visiting-guide-quality-audit-deliverable":"Audit report with photo evidence, risk ratings, and corrective-action recommendations.","agents-visiting-guide-quality-audit-deliverable--plural":"Audit report with photo evidence, risk ratings, and corrective-action recommendations.","agents-visiting-guide-one-stop-itinerary-planning-desc":"We craft a visit schedule perfectly aligned with your business goals—optimizing factory tours, trade-show slots, and market visits to maximize every day on the ground.","agents-visiting-guide-one-stop-itinerary-planning-desc--plural":"We craft a visit schedule perfectly aligned with your business goals—optimizing factory tours, trade-show slots, and market visits to maximize every day on the ground.","agents-visiting-guide-supplier-assessment-deliverable":"Shortlist matrix ranking each supplier on cost, quality, capacity, and strategic fit.","agents-visiting-guide-supplier-assessment-deliverable--plural":"Shortlist matrix ranking each supplier on cost, quality, capacity, and strategic fit.","agents-visiting-guide-negotiation-support-expertise":"Professional interpreters with industry know-how and real-time coaching on Chinese business etiquette.","agents-visiting-guide-negotiation-support-expertise--plural":"Professional interpreters with industry know-how and real-time coaching on Chinese business etiquette.","agents-visiting-guide-faq-5-answer":"You’ll receive a detailed rating of each factory’s capacity, compliance credentials, past performance, and risk factors.","agents-visiting-guide-faq-5-answer--plural":"You’ll receive a detailed rating of each factory’s capacity, compliance credentials, past performance, and risk factors.","agents-visiting-guide-rigorous-quality-audits-desc":"On-site production-line inspections combined with third-party lab testing pin down hidden defects and compliance risks before you commit.","agents-visiting-guide-rigorous-quality-audits-desc--plural":"On-site production-line inspections combined with third-party lab testing pin down hidden defects and compliance risks before you commit.","agents-visiting-guide-faq-1-answer":"Absolutely. We tailor factory visits, trade-show sessions, and market tours specifically to your industry and product needs.","agents-visiting-guide-faq-1-answer--plural":"Absolutely. We tailor factory visits, trade-show sessions, and market tours specifically to your industry and product needs.","agents-visiting-guide-faq-6":"Do you offer virtual follow-up after the trip?","agents-visiting-guide-faq-6--plural":"Do you offer virtual follow-up after the trip?","agents-visiting-guide-faq-5":"What is included in the post-trip Supplier Assessment report?","agents-visiting-guide-faq-5--plural":"What is included in the post-trip Supplier Assessment report?","agents-visiting-guide-faq-4":"Can you help negotiate payment and shipping terms?","agents-visiting-guide-faq-4--plural":"Can you help negotiate payment and shipping terms?","agents-visiting-guide-faq-3-answer":"We perform production-line walkthroughs, spot checks, AQL sampling, and coordinate third-party lab tests when required.","agents-visiting-guide-faq-3-answer--plural":"We perform production-line walkthroughs, spot checks, AQL sampling, and coordinate third-party lab tests when required.","agents-visiting-guide-itinerary-planning-deliverable":"Detailed travel dossier (transport routes, local contacts, meeting briefs) that fits your objectives.","agents-visiting-guide-itinerary-planning-deliverable--plural":"Detailed travel dossier (transport routes, local contacts, meeting briefs) that fits your objectives.","agents-visiting-guide-deliverable-label":"Deliverable:","agents-visiting-guide-deliverable-label--plural":"Deliverable:","agents-visiting-guide-audit-negotiation":"Audit & Negotiation","agents-visiting-guide-audit-negotiation--plural":"Audit & Negotiation","agents-visiting-guide-faq-3":"How do you conduct on-site quality audits?","agents-visiting-guide-faq-3--plural":"How do you conduct on-site quality audits?","agents-visiting-guide-faq-2":"What qualifications do your interpreters have?","agents-visiting-guide-faq-2--plural":"What qualifications do your interpreters have?","agents-visiting-guide-faq-1":"Can you customize the itinerary based on my product category?","agents-visiting-guide-faq-1--plural":"Can you customize the itinerary based on my product category?","agents-visiting-guide-itinerary-briefing":"Itinerary & Briefing","agents-visiting-guide-itinerary-briefing--plural":"Itinerary & Briefing","agents-visiting-guide-wasted-time-in-traffic-and-unproductive-meetings":"Wasted time in traffic and unproductive meetings","agents-visiting-guide-wasted-time-in-traffic-and-unproductive-meetings--plural":"Wasted time in traffic and unproductive meetings","agents-visiting-guide-itinerary-planning-desc":"Streamlined schedules that pack high-value factory visits, trade shows, and market tours in minimal days.","agents-visiting-guide-itinerary-planning-desc--plural":"Streamlined schedules that pack high-value factory visits, trade shows, and market tours in minimal days.","agents-visiting-guide-quality-audit-challenge":"Surface-level visits miss hidden defects and non-compliance.","agents-visiting-guide-quality-audit-challenge--plural":"Surface-level visits miss hidden defects and non-compliance.","agents-visiting-guide-language-barriers-that-weaken-negotiation-leverage":"Language barriers that weaken negotiation leverage","agents-visiting-guide-language-barriers-that-weaken-negotiation-leverage--plural":"Language barriers that weaken negotiation leverage","agents-visiting-guide-professional-negotiation-support":"Professional Negotiation Support","agents-visiting-guide-professional-negotiation-support--plural":"Professional Negotiation Support","agents-visiting-guide-negotiation-support-deliverable":"Negotiation playbook & on-site interpreter backing every discussion, plus written summaries of agreed terms.","agents-visiting-guide-negotiation-support-deliverable--plural":"Negotiation playbook & on-site interpreter backing every discussion, plus written summaries of agreed terms.","agents-visiting-guide-negotiation-support":"Negotiation Support","agents-visiting-guide-negotiation-support--plural":"Negotiation Support","agents-visiting-guide-faq-6-answer":"We conduct debrief calls, assist with sample approvals, and help transition into production planning remotely.","agents-visiting-guide-faq-6-answer--plural":"We conduct debrief calls, assist with sample approvals, and help transition into production planning remotely.","agents-visiting-guide-challenge-label":"Challenge:","agents-visiting-guide-challenge-label--plural":"Challenge:","agents-visiting-guide-negotiation-support-challenge":"Language gaps and cultural nuances can cost you price concessions.","agents-visiting-guide-negotiation-support-challenge--plural":"Language gaps and cultural nuances can cost you price concessions.","agents-visiting-guide-faq-2-answer":"Our interpreters hold professional Mandarin–English translation certifications and have hands-on experience in manufacturing or trade negotiations.","agents-visiting-guide-faq-2-answer--plural":"Our interpreters hold professional Mandarin–English translation certifications and have hands-on experience in manufacturing or trade negotiations.","agents-shorten-delivery-time-process-production-acceleration":"Production Acceleration","agents-shorten-delivery-time-process-production-acceleration--plural":"Production Acceleration","agents-visiting-guide-consult":"Consult","agents-visiting-guide-consult--plural":"Consult","agents-visiting-guide-rigorous-quality-audits":"Rigorous Quality Audits","agents-visiting-guide-rigorous-quality-audits--plural":"Rigorous Quality Audits","agents-visiting-guide-post-trip-action-plan":"Post-Trip Action Plan","agents-visiting-guide-post-trip-action-plan--plural":"Post-Trip Action Plan","agents-visiting-guide-hidden-quality-issues-uncovered-too-late":"Hidden quality issues uncovered too late","agents-visiting-guide-hidden-quality-issues-uncovered-too-late--plural":"Hidden quality issues uncovered too late","agents-visiting-guide-request-a-custom-trip-itinerary":"Request a Custom Trip Itinerary","agents-visiting-guide-request-a-custom-trip-itinerary--plural":"Request a Custom Trip Itinerary","agents-visiting-guide-unverified-suppliers-with-unknown-risks":"Unverified suppliers with unknown risks","agents-visiting-guide-unverified-suppliers-with-unknown-risks--plural":"Unverified suppliers with unknown risks","agents-visiting-guide-supplier-assessment-challenge":"Hard to differentiate genuine manufacturers from trading intermediaries.","agents-visiting-guide-supplier-assessment-challenge--plural":"Hard to differentiate genuine manufacturers from trading intermediaries.","agents-visiting-guide-supplier-assessment":"Supplier Assessment","agents-visiting-guide-supplier-assessment--plural":"Supplier Assessment","agents-visiting-guide-supplier-assessment-desc":"Comprehensive vetting—capacity checks, compliance reviews, reference interviews—to shortlist only reliable partners.","agents-vi