, certifications, export history, and client references—shortlisting only genuine manufacturers and weeding out trading intermediaries.","agents-visiting-guide-in-depth-supplier-assessment-desc--plural":"We vet factory capacity, certifications, export history, and client references—shortlisting only genuine manufacturers and weeding out trading intermediaries.","agents-visiting-guide-quality-audits":"Quality Audits","agents-visiting-guide-quality-audits--plural":"Quality Audits","agents-visiting-guide-supplier-assessment-expertise":"Deep-dive background checks—production capacity, export history, existing client references, and compliance credentials.","agents-visiting-guide-supplier-assessment-expertise--plural":"Deep-dive background checks—production capacity, export history, existing client references, and compliance credentials.","agents-visiting-guide-ready-to-make-your-china-trip-100%-productive":"Ready to Make Your China Trip 100% Productive?","agents-visiting-guide-ready-to-make-your-china-trip-100%-productive--plural":"Ready to Make Your China Trip 100% Productive?","agents-visiting-guide-quality-audit-desc":"On-site pre-production and in-line AQL inspections, backed by third-party lab testing coordination.","agents-visiting-guide-quality-audit-desc--plural":"On-site pre-production and in-line AQL inspections, backed by third-party lab testing coordination.","agents-visiting-guide-on-site-visits":"On-Site Visits","agents-visiting-guide-on-site-visits--plural":"On-Site Visits","agents-visiting-guide-faq-4-answer":"Yes. Your guide facilitates price, MOQ, lead-time discussions, and helps structure clear payment and delivery agreements.","agents-visiting-guide-faq-4-answer--plural":"Yes. Your guide facilitates price, MOQ, lead-time discussions, and helps structure clear payment and delivery agreements.","agents-shorten-delivery-time-sign-up-free":"Sign Up Free","agents-shorten-delivery-time-sign-up-free--plural":"Sign Up Free","agents-cogs-reduction-faq-5-answer-new":"You’ll typically see initial savings within 6-8 weeks of kick-off (after baseline audit and pilot roll-out).","agents-cogs-reduction-faq-5-answer-new--plural":"You’ll typically see initial savings within 6-8 weeks of kick-off (after baseline audit and pilot roll-out).","common-costs-us-tips":"CJEC Amsterdam 2026 — Grow your eCommerce business,100% Free. - Join for Free","ready-to-ship-overview-section3-problem2-a":"CJ's Solution:  We have optimized physical attribute algorithms for over 200 countries. Based on actual product weight and volume—combined with precision templates—we provide the most compatible shipping solutions. This ensures that the shipping cost displayed upfront is your final cost.","ready-to-ship-overview-section3-problem2-a--plural":"CJ's Solution:  We have optimized physical attribute algorithms for over 200 countries. Based on actual product weight and volume—combined with precision templates—we provide the most compatible shipping solutions. This ensures that the shipping cost displayed upfront is your final cost.","ready-to-ship-shoplazza-title-line1":"Discover","ready-to-ship-shoplazza-title-line1--plural":"Discover","ready-to-ship-shoplazza-title-line2":"premium selections","ready-to-ship-shoplazza-title-line2--plural":"premium selections","ready-to-ship-ebay-item1-title":"Cross-Border Direct","ready-to-ship-ebay-item1-title--plural":"Cross-Border Direct","ready-to-ship-mercado-item1-highlight":"fastest","ready-to-ship-mercado-item1-highlight--plural":"fastest","ready-to-ship-tiktok-title":"TRENDS AT YOUR DOORSTEP","ready-to-ship-tiktok-title--plural":"TRENDS AT YOUR DOORSTEP","ready-to-ship-ebay-title-selection":"SELECTION,","ready-to-ship-ebay-title-selection--plural":"SELECTION,","ready-to-ship-mercado-item2-highlight":"Borderless","ready-to-ship-mercado-item2-highlight--plural":"Borderless","ready-to-ship-lazada-badge2-title":"Local Fast Shipping","ready-to-ship-lazada-badge2-title--plural":"Local Fast Shipping","ready-to-ship-overview-section2-text":"For shop owners and e-commerce sellers pursuing efficiency and fast capital turnover, RTS is the best tool for risk reduction:","ready-to-ship-overview-section2-text--plural":"For shop owners and e-commerce sellers pursuing efficiency and fast capital turnover, RTS is the best tool for risk reduction:","ready-to-ship-lazada-label-highlight":"24–48 Hours","ready-to-ship-lazada-label-highlight--plural":"24–48 Hours","ready-to-ship-ebay-badge-suffix":"Business Days","ready-to-ship-ebay-badge-suffix--plural":"Business Days","ready-to-ship-temu-item1-label":"Local Stock (Y1)","ready-to-ship-temu-item1-label--plural":"Local Stock (Y1)","ready-to-ship-overview-section3-problem2-q":"The Problem:  Many platforms provide inaccurate shipping estimates, leading to unexpectedly high costs at checkout.","ready-to-ship-overview-section3-problem2-q--plural":"The Problem:  Many platforms provide inaccurate shipping estimates, leading to unexpectedly high costs at checkout.","ready-to-ship-shein-subtitle":"Fresh arrivals added daily","ready-to-ship-shein-subtitle--plural":"Fresh arrivals added daily","ready-to-ship-temu-item2-desc":"Shipped Within 48 Hours","ready-to-ship-temu-item2-desc--plural":"Shipped Within 48 Hours","ready-to-ship-shoplazza-top":"ALWAYS IN STOCK. ALWAYS READY","ready-to-ship-shoplazza-top--plural":"ALWAYS IN STOCK. ALWAYS READY","ready-to-ship-mercado-item2-prefix":"International Selection:","ready-to-ship-mercado-item2-prefix--plural":"International Selection:","ready-to-ship-temu-title-main":"GLOBAL CHOICE,","ready-to-ship-temu-title-main--plural":"GLOBAL CHOICE,","ready-to-ship-overview-section3-problem3-a":"CJ's Solution: We use big data to filter products. Only items with moderate weight, stable logistics attributes, and the fastest processing speeds within the CJ system are marked as RTS. We essentially complete the first round of \"logistics and quality\" pre-vetting for you.","ready-to-ship-overview-section3-problem3-a--plural":"C