LOCAL","ready-to-ship-overview-section2-item4":"Transparent Fulfillment:  Prices, shipping costs, and delivery times are all public, making it easy to accurately estimate your own retail price and profit margins.","ready-to-ship-overview-section2-item4--plural":"Transparent Fulfillment:  Prices, shipping costs, and delivery times are all public, making it easy to accurately estimate your own retail price and profit margins.","ready-to-ship-overview-section2-item3":"High Decision-Making Efficiency:  Say goodbye to time-zone-crossing communications and tedious inquiry processes. \"What you see is what you get,\" allowing you to complete global sourcing in seconds.","ready-to-ship-overview-section2-item3--plural":"High Decision-Making Efficiency:  Say goodbye to time-zone-crossing communications and tedious inquiry processes. \"What you see is what you get,\" allowing you to complete global sourcing in seconds.","ready-to-ship-ebay-badge-highlight":"1–2","ready-to-ship-ebay-badge-highlight--plural":"1–2","ready-to-ship-etsy-badge":"Dispatched with Care within 1-3 Business Days","ready-to-ship-etsy-badge--plural":"Dispatched with Care within 1-3 Business Days","ready-to-ship-overview-section2-item2":"Fast Capital Turnover:  No need to pay large deposits upfront. Shipping begins immediately after the order is placed, keeping your cash flow active.","ready-to-ship-overview-section2-item2--plural":"Fast Capital Turnover:  No need to pay large deposits upfront. Shipping begins immediately after the order is placed, keeping your cash flow active.","ready-to-ship-temu-item1-desc":"As Fast as 2-Day Delivery","ready-to-ship-temu-item1-desc--plural":"As Fast as 2-Day Delivery","ready-to-ship-etsy-title-line1":"CRAFTED WITH LOVE,","ready-to-ship-etsy-title-line1--plural":"CRAFTED WITH LOVE,","ready-to-ship-overview-section2-item1":"Low Market Testing Costs:  Supports extremely low MOQs (Minimum Order Quantities). You can purchase as few as 5-10 units of a new product to test the 