ct criteria:","ready-to-ship-overview-section1-text--plural":"RTS (Ready to Ship) refers to an \"in-stock\" or \"ready-stock\" trading model. Unlike the traditional \"inquiry first, production later\" model, RTS products must meet the following strict criteria:","ready-to-ship-overview-section1-item3":"Logistics Certainty:  The system automatically calculates global shipping costs and provides a clear estimated time of arrival (ETA).","ready-to-ship-overview-section1-item3--plural":"Logistics Certainty:  The system automatically calculates global shipping costs and provides a clear estimated time of arrival (ETA).","ready-to-ship-overview-section1-item2":"Direct Purchase:   Specifications and prices are fixed. Buyers can click to buy just like retail shopping, without the need for business negotiations.","ready-to-ship-overview-section1-item2--plural":"Direct Purchase:   Specifications and prices are fixed. Buyers can click to buy just like retail shopping, without the need for business negotiations.","ready-to-ship-overview-section1-item4":"Fast Dispatch:   Orders are typically shipped within 3 to 15 days (or even sooner).","ready-to-ship-overview-section1-item4--plural":"Fast Dispatch:   Orders are typically shipped within 3 to 15 days (or even sooner).","ready-to-ship-overview-section1-item1":"In-Stock Supply:  Products are already stocked in the warehouse; there is no long production lead time.","ready-to-ship-overview-section1-item1--plural":"In-Stock Supply:  Products are already stocked in the warehouse; there is no long production lead time.","ready-to-ship-overview-section2-title":"2. What are the Advantages of RTS Products for Small Business Sellers?","ready-to-ship-overview-section2-title--plural":"2. What are the Advantages of RTS Products for Small Business Sellers?","ready-to-ship-overview-section3-problem1-a":"CJ's Solution: We use real-time API synchronization for inventory data. Every number you see represents actual available stock. Once inventory 